# Business Logic First (Global Rule)

- Focus tests, reviews, and docs on domain behavior and user-visible outcomes.
- Avoid coupling to implementation details (fillable, table names, PKs, private methods, specific query structures).
- Prefer verifying workflows, invariants, and state transitions via actions, HTTP endpoints, widgets, and domain services.
- Combine with NO RefreshDatabase policy: minimal fixtures, explicit setup when DB is needed.
- Applies across modules, CI, and code reviews.
